# Version pins for provisioned tools (Linux).
# Override by editing this file or exporting env vars before running.
#
# Each tag carries the SHA-256 of its Linux release archive per architecture
# (<TOOL>_SHA256_X86_64 / <TOOL>_SHA256_AARCH64). install/lib/installers.sh
# installs only an archive matching these; the release's own checksum file,
# when there is one, is just a cross-check. Changing a tag means changing its
# two hashes in the same commit. All values read 2026-10-08 from the GitHub
# API asset digests (https://api.github.com/repos/<repo>/releases/tags/<tag>,
# field assets[].digest) and, where a release publishes one, checked against
# the checksum file named on each line.

# https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/download/v1.24.2/starship-<arch>-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256
